Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.98,1:20:52.94,ED eng,,0,0,0,,{=20}{\fad(80,80)}Make me sick, I have a feeling I'm going to dry up
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.55,1:21:03.98,ED eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Let me hear your voice, I'm gonna break down it's not AYAKASHI is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.98,1:21:07.73,ED eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Is it over already? Do you erase me? I become KATAMORI
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.77,1:21:11.32,ED eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Is it over already? Do you erase me? I become AYAKASHI
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.01,1:21:18.48,ED eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}You stripped it from me, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.01,1:21:25.26,ED eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}I touched you calling it "love"
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.40,1:21:33.81,ED eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}My heart is filled, yeah you are the only one
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.81,1:21:41.32,ED eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Love sick, love sick, love sick Hey I'm chasing
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.45,1:21:47.57,ED eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Love sick, love sick, love sick Hey
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.65,1:21:51.34,ED eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}What you sacrificed to get what you want
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.34,1:21:54.84,ED eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Try measuring it on a scale
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.04,1:21:59.31,ED eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Were you able to change? Did you dry up?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.31,1:22:03.98,ED eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Naked disease that mourns in this fleeting world
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.74,1:22:07.40,ED eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)\an3}No no no mononoke sweet sickness
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.40,1:22:11.15,ED eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}No no no mononoke sweet sickness
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.15,1:22:14.81,ED eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}No no no mononoke sweet sickness
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.81,1:22:17.77,ED eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}No no no let it reach you
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.48,1:22:21.94,ED eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Is it over already? Do you erase me? I become KATAMORI
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.98,1:22:23.77,ED eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Is it over already? Do you erase me?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.90,1:22:29.77,ED eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}I have a feeling I can't be myself
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.24,1:22:37.17,ED eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}I felt lonely and left behind by the world
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.70,1:22:40.61,ED eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}I crave for love
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.61,1:22:47.31,ED eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Dumping the sickness that tortures me
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.31,1:22:55.73,ED eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}into the gaping hole of the muddy well
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.73,1:23:03.17,ED eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Let me embrace a new color
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.56,1:23:16.57,ED eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Everything that's been sacrificed is gasping for eternity
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.98,1:23:21.02,ED eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Was I able to change? Did I break down?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.31,1:23:26.10,ED eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Leave me alone at the end of the end
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.15,1:23:31.31,ED eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The tears inside me began to dance
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.98,1:23:38.73,ED eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And wet my pain blooming the flowers of sorrow
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.15,1:23:44.35,ED eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}But do I suffer until I die?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.35,1:23:48.69,ED eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Will I be able to laugh someday?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.69,1:23:54.27,ED eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Will I be able to love?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.27,1:23:55.98,ED eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}An obvious sickness
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.94,1:24:01.73,ED eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}No no no let it reach you
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.73,1:24:08.90,ED eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Embracing what can't be stripped away
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.90,1:24:17.77,ED eng,,0,0,0,,{=21}{\fad(80,80)}Will I be able to see you again even if I break? Terribly sweet sickness
