Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.88,0:01:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{=8}I'm finally here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.33,0:01:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ōoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.13,0:01:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take your offerings\N for the Birth Celebratory Ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.38,0:01:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Form a line.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.58,0:01:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ōoku is off-limits to men.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.67,0:01:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Only women with a pass may enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.25,0:01:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this the Ōoku?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.75,0:01:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my! This is so exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.75,0:01:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.67,0:01:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness! They've kept their shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.67,0:01:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Know what they are?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.79,0:01:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't, but I'm sure they're delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.88,0:01:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Rice balls with magnolia leaf miso.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.25,0:01:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,They smell good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.96,0:01:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- Would you like one?\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.38,0:02:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,My grandmother gave me \N plenty for everyone in the Ōoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.79,0:02:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here to work in the Ōoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.38,0:02:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Kame.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.00,0:02:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I also begin work in the Ōoku today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.83,0:02:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Asa.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.25,0:02:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Simply irresistible...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.38,0:02:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The charred smell\N of miso and magnolia leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.83,0:02:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, you can try one too if you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.92,0:02:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I would appreciate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.96,0:02:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.38,0:02:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You two over there.\N Lady Asa and Lady Kame, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.83,0:02:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you're both\N as beautiful as I've heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.67,0:02:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Much obliged.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.33,0:02:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.71,0:02:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The long journey must have been tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.25,0:02:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Sakashita, a palace guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.63,0:02:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,As a doorman of the Ōoku,\NI watch over the Nanatsu Gate here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.92,0:02:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let me take your luggage.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.33,0:02:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.46,0:03:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,However, this is all I have.\NI can carry it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.75,0:03:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.88,0:03:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But Lady Kame,\Nyou have a lot of luggage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.92,0:03:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Sakashita, please try\N one of my grandmother's rice balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.79,0:03:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, they smell so nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.08,0:03:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall I prepare\N a special love potion for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.75,0:03:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Who the heck are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.42,0:03:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a humble medicine seller.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.33,0:03:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I sell such things as British love potions
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.54,0:03:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,that can effortlessly enchant any woman--
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.71,0:03:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not interested!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.38,0:03:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a fishy fellow, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.42,0:03:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with your outfit, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.13,0:03:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Asa, Lady Kame.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.83,0:03:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You should stay away from guys like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.58,0:03:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing good will come of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.42,0:03:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let's continue\N this conversation later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.46,0:03:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're quite a character!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.08,0:03:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,See you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.67,0:04:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiramoto, we're in the Ōoku now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.67,0:04:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Behave yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.75,0:04:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Saburomaru.\N I sense beautiful women approaching.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.75,0:04:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't those two gorgeous?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.21,0:04:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Get a hold of yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.75,0:04:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep messing around,\N and I'll throw out your pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.50,0:04:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so uptight.\N Let's enjoy ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.46,0:04:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Just for confirmation,\N show me your passes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.79,0:04:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.00,0:04:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Senior maids Madam Awashima\N and Madam Mugitani are waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.00,0:04:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,First impressions are everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.65,0:04:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.23,0:04:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I will introduce myself right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.44,0:04:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget to eat your rice ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.96,0:04:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.42,0:04:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.88,0:04:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you require that love potion?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.42,0:04:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ōoku is not\N a place for people like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.79,0:05:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It is reserved for the women\N gathered to serve His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.58,0:05:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The Nanatsu Gate is as far as you can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.83,0:05:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Should you enter without permission,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.83,0:05:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll be beheaded on sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.79,0:05:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,See you later, Medicine Seller!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.71,0:05:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And I don't need any love potions!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.17,0:05:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.21,0:05:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.33,0:06:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.63,0:06:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.46,0:06:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Madam Awashima,\N who deals with visitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.17,0:06:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Mugitani.\N I manage daily tasks and events.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.21,0:06:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Asa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.67,0:06:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Kame.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.71,0:06:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We look forward to working with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.63,0:06:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.58,0:06:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the water of\N the Water Goddess, who watches over us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.04,0:06:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,All women who live in the Ōoku\N drink this water every morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.75,0:06:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Under the protection of the Water Goddess,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.08,0:06:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,we are always prepared\N to produce a successor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.96,0:07:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, take the most cherished\N belongings you've brought from home
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.29,0:07:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,and offer them to this well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.54,0:07:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Throw away the person you were until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.92,0:07:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The person I was until now...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.38,0:07:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Throw away?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.96,0:07:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We all become property of His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.25,0:07:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- We must offer our hearts and bodies.\N- They're only objects.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.21,0:07:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That... That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.79,0:07:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.17,0:07:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,My grandmother gave me these rice balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.00,0:07:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought we could all...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.17,0:07:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,enjoy them together... but, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.33,0:07:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- Wha--\N- Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.29,0:07:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I'm sure\Nthis has helped strengthen your resolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.17,0:07:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings, Madam Utayama.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.83,0:07:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If you cling onto\Nall your cherished items,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.67,0:07:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,you will be unable to perform your duties.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.00,0:07:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,With all due respect,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.17,0:08:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,do our duties require\N throwing away our cherished belongings?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.79,0:08:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,My, you certainly speak your mind,don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.58,0:08:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I've practiced writing since an early age.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.00,0:08:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Due to my accomplishments,\N I was given the opportunity to come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.63,0:08:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, my father has instructed\N me to continue my studies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.79,0:08:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,However, I have nothing\N too important to throw away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.67,0:08:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You have nothing that precious?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.88,0:08:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- This comb is from my grandmother.\N- Kame!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.42,0:08:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,She told me to keep it for good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.17,0:08:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! There's no need to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.63,0:08:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.50,0:08:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to do well here in the Ōoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.71,0:09:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Something... has taken form.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.92,0:09:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll get wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.54,0:09:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,M-Madam Utayama!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.00,0:09:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry you had to witness this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.54,0:09:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You two! What are you doing?\NShow some respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.79,0:09:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Madam Utayama,\Nmanager of the Ōoku,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.25,0:09:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,and this is the concubine Lady Botan!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.96,0:09:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Madam Awashima, I see\N this newcomer has {\i1}perfect{\i} manners.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.71,0:09:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I apologize! It seems she lacks\Nthe proper mindset to perform her duties.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.17,0:10:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I am ready to dedicate\Nmy life to my duties.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.42,0:10:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ōoku is not a place\Nfor you to find fulfillment.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.88,0:10:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.38,0:10:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you talk back to Madam Utayama!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.54,0:10:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Rather than forging your own path,\Nyou must contribute to the Ōoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.00,0:10:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Both you and I are here for that purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.58,0:10:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,As you fulfill your role,\Nyou will gain a higher perspective.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.17,0:10:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A higher perspective...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.50,0:10:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,In time, you will realize that\N the doubt in your heart was insignificant.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.38,0:10:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall also bear this in mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.63,0:10:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Madam Utayama, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.42,0:10:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We mustn't keep the gentlemen waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.83,0:10:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Madam Mugitani,\Nyou try not to go overboard either.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.83,0:10:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Lady Botan!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.88,0:10:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Sakashita?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.13,0:11:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.25,0:11:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What is all this commotion about?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.96,0:11:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't know about the ceremony?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.92,0:11:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I smelled an opportunity to make a profit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.79,0:11:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.21,0:11:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Yukiko, the consort,\N has given birth to His Majesty's child.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.08,0:11:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,This great festival is\N to celebrate the occasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.75,0:11:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't a ceremony like this\N normally held {\i1}before{\i} the birth?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.92,0:11:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! That's because...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.88,0:11:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.58,0:11:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Madam Utayama will be arriving shortly!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.04,0:11:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me! Please stop!\N That's Madam Utayama's...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.38,0:11:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.71,0:11:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I apologize for keeping you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.33,0:11:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Saburomaru Tokita.\NThis is Hiramoto Saga.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.13,0:11:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We only just arrived too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.42,0:11:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Why was the Birth Celebratory Ceremony\Npostponed two months ago--
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.96,0:11:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, leave everything to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.67,0:12:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We were called here\N because we cannot leave everything to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.17,0:12:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It is as the report states.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.63,0:12:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Simple lack of preparation doesn't explain this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.63,0:12:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I already reported \Nthis matter to Councilor Otomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.29,0:12:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I was instructed to \Ndeal with this internally.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.50,0:12:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Councilor Otomo?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.63,0:12:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I am of the Otomo family,\Nand I serve in the Ōoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.71,0:12:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Botan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.79,0:12:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It is said that Lady Yukiko\Nhad a very difficult childbirth
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.50,0:12:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,and is completely exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.33,0:12:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Some suggest that this is because\Nthe ceremony was not held two months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.83,0:12:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, Madam Utayama,\Nyou are the one responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.46,0:12:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.33,0:12:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That is why we made\Nthe rare decision to hold the ceremony
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.79,0:12:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,after the childbirth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.71,0:12:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Our duty is to oversee the Ōoku--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.38,0:12:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ōoku belongs to His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.88,0:12:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Know your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.83,0:12:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.79,0:12:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But the government \Nsent us here to supervise and ensure
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.96,0:12:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,that the ceremony proceeds smoothly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.92,0:13:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You must have heard this\N from Councilor Otomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.33,0:13:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.75,0:13:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,However, I ask that \Nyou refrain from your vulgar prying
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.71,0:13:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,and your excessive interactions\Nwith the maids of the Ōoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.21,0:13:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Ōoku,\Nwhere men are usually forbidden to enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.67,0:13:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You may be doing your duty,\Nbut rule breakers shall be punished,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.33,0:13:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}no matter who they are.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.83,0:13:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.92,0:13:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Please make arrangements\Nso that we can begin our work tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.17,0:13:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.38,0:13:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Suma is dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.71,0:13:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.71,0:13:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiyo is also dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.92,0:13:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.54,0:13:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuki is not dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.71,0:14:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- Matron.\N- Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.54,0:14:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I am dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.08,0:14:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Fuki again?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.71,0:14:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,His Majesty is rather fervent, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.29,0:14:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ōoku employs roughly 2,000 maids.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.71,0:14:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You are to prepare breakfast\Nfor everyone before sunrise.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.79,0:14:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.46,0:14:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.58,0:14:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,First, you'll prepare meals\Nfor 50 people in the fourth building.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.79,0:14:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,When you're ready,\Nit will go up to 100 people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.25,0:14:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,A hundred?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.67,0:14:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Be sure to finish\Nyour own breakfast before you begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.83,0:14:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.83,0:14:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Your writing is so neat, Asa!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.17,0:14:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,How early do we need to \Nwake up in time for "before sunrise"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.92,0:14:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I used to make breakfast\Nfor my neighbors every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.21,0:14:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.42,0:15:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never even made breakfast before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.54,0:15:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear Lord Saburomaru is\Nthe concubine Lady Fuki's younger brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.21,0:15:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He is the third son of the Tokita family.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.17,0:15:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't change anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.71,0:15:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall proceed in earnest\Nfor the Birth Celebratory Ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.00,0:15:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The Tokita family\Nhas been gaining momentum lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.25,0:15:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to avoid fighting them\Nand giving them additional leverage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.71,0:15:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I say this\Nas a member of the Otomo family.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.08,0:15:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Madam Utayama, you too are\Nunder the Otomo family's protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.21,0:15:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps we should let them feel\Nas though they've done some work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.08,0:15:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The two of you will have\Nthe rank of maidservant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.21,0:15:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You will sleep\Nin a room on the second floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.17,0:15:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You will serve Madam Awashima...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.79,0:15:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Two thousand maids?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.96,0:15:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And only eight of them\Nget to serve His Majesty as a concubine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.79,0:15:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- For cleaning...\N- The longest journey begins with one step.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.88,0:16:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,...take the initiative.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.33,0:16:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.42,0:16:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.08,0:16:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They are the concubines.\NBe sure to make way for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.00,0:16:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We are like decorative flowers\Nused to enhance Lady Fuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.54,0:16:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The concubines are here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.29,0:16:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears His Majesty\Nonly has eyes for Lady Fuki now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.92,0:16:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you hear me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.67,0:16:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.42,0:16:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope His Majesty would pick\Nthe flowers too once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.88,0:16:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,His Majesty first spoke to me\Nwhen I was still a mere bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.79,0:16:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure the time will come\Nfor all of you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.83,0:16:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,L-Lady Fuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.75,0:16:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.08,0:16:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,My, how... beautiful you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.38,0:16:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be new.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.83,0:16:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am! My name is Kame.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.00,0:16:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.25,0:17:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,How long are you going\Nto waste time selling medicine?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.17,0:17:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're closing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.75,0:17:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I have more to offer than medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.46,0:17:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm not wasting any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.46,0:17:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you drinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.08,0:17:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I've decided not to drink\Nuntil our work here is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.58,0:17:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a dull man, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.63,0:17:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This task may be\Nmore difficult than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.63,0:17:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,All we have to do is look at pretty girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.63,0:17:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite the perk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.00,0:17:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ōoku does more than \Njust produce His Majesty's successor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.38,0:17:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.04,0:17:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The shogunate and the Ōoku\Nare two sides of the same coin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.29,0:17:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Power relations on the outside\Nare maintained by the work done here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.96,0:18:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind politics.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.25,0:18:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,If no successor is produced,\Nwhat's the point of the Ōoku,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.25,0:18:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.50,0:18:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't mean to \Nspeak ill of your elder sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.17,0:18:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Our duty is to oversee\Nthe Birth Celebratory Ceremony,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.83,0:18:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,but people outside the Ōoku\Nare targeting Madam Utayama.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.92,0:18:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That old woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.75,0:18:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.50,0:18:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I see why it's hard for those outside\Nto carry out their plans in the Ōoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.38,0:18:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose that's why they wish\Nto reduce Madam Utayama's influence.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.17,0:18:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stand that look on her face,\Nas if she rules the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.21,0:18:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be hard to be\Nthe third son of the Tokita family.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.63,0:18:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You got this job thanks to Lady Fuki,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.63,0:18:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,so you'll need to produce good results.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.29,0:18:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why was the Birth Celebratory Ceremony\Npostponed two months ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.92,0:18:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.71,0:18:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps Madam Utayama \Nhas held power in the Ōoku for too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.63,0:19:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that water smelled really bad, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.29,0:19:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yeah... It smelled rancid.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.33,0:19:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How do Madam Awashima \Nand the others drink it so easily?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.92,0:19:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- Look out for fire!\N- Look out for fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.54,0:19:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is it because \Nthey're doing it for His Majesty?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.54,0:19:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I wish I could become \Na concubine like Lady Fuki already.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.46,0:19:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,She was very pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.67,0:19:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When we passed by Lady Fuki today,\NMadam Mugitani's eyes lit up too.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.71,0:19:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Lady Fuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.54,0:19:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,How pretty...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.83,0:19:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,All of the concubines are pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.00,0:19:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Even yours did, right, Asa?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.13,0:19:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Personally,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.79,0:19:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}rather than become a glamorous concubine,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.29,0:19:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd prefer to learn a skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.96,0:20:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, my goal is\Nto take on the role of official scribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.25,0:20:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The intensity of His Majesty's affection\Ntowards Lady Fuki as of late...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.58,0:20:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Lady Yukiko's child\Nwas another girl, you see.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.54,0:20:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Lady Fuki must be very skilled.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.96,0:20:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}At this rate,\NHis Majesty's successor will be...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.33,0:20:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Asa, you seem like\Nyou could do anything well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.67,0:20:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I can \Nmake it here in the Ōoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.54,0:20:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be fine.\NLet's do our best together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.71,0:20:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Lady Yukiko hasn't been picked for some time.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.25,0:20:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Lady Fuki's influence continues to grow.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.04,0:21:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As for Lady Botan of the Otomo family...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.63,0:21:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She doesn't seem interested in night work.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.79,0:21:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Asa!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.42,0:21:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really glad I met you, Asa.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.63,0:21:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.92,0:21:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We start early tomorrow.\NLet's get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.83,0:21:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.92,0:21:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.04,0:22:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All manner of misfortune{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.25,0:22:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sin and defilement{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.88,0:22:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Purify{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.42,0:22:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Cleanse{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.33,0:22:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}By the will of heaven{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.75,0:23:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- The Water Goddess is not fond of fire.\N- {\i1}Protect us{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.17,0:23:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Grant us good fortune{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.33,0:23:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Madam Utayama.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.79,0:23:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.50,0:23:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.00,0:23:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The recently postponed\NBirth Celebratory Ceremony
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.00,0:23:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,is now three days away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.75,0:23:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Many guests will arrive on that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.88,0:23:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,In the few days we have left,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.08,0:24:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I want everyone to remain focused\Nas we make preparations.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.58,0:24:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Only women with a pass may enter!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.63,0:24:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take your offerings for the ceremony!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.96,0:24:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No men are to enter the Ōoku!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.67,0:24:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Form a line!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.08,0:24:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it still... far away?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.00,0:24:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall now announce personnel\Nfor the Birth Celebratory Ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.04,0:24:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Awashima will coordinate\Nthis Birth Celebratory Ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.33,0:24:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Her role will change \Nfrom head housemaid to greeter of dignitaries.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.17,0:24:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,From decorations to food and drink,\Neverything must be handled efficiently.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.71,0:24:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone is to follow\NAwashima's instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.29,0:24:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,There may be over 100 participants\Nat this Birth Celebratory Ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.79,0:24:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,From seating arrangements\Nto guidance upon leaving,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.13,0:24:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,there is no room for error.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.00,0:24:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Mugitani's role will change from housemaid\Nto head housemaid to take on this duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.33,0:24:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Mugitani will receive support
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.25,0:25:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,from somebody with knowledge of relations\Nbetween the shogunate and powerful lords.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.79,0:25:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Concubine Otomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.00,0:25:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Mugitani, be sure\Nto seek guidance from Otomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.25,0:25:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.71,0:25:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And although she just arrived yesterday,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.88,0:25:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I have something to ask of Asa too.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.46,0:25:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,She will act as a guide
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.92,0:25:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,for Saburomaru Tokita and Hiramoto Saga,\Ninspectors from the shogunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.21,0:25:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This may be unusual,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.83,0:25:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,but I will assign Asa\Nthe rank of housemaid.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.79,0:25:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,May I ask you two to say a few words?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.21,0:25:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done, Asa!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.75,0:25:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Saburomaru Tokita.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.58,0:25:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Asa, I appreciate your assistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.00,0:25:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- Tokita? Is he related to Lady Fuki?\N- He's so flippant.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.85,0:25:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,...Madam Mugitani,\NI'll be counting on your help!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.04,0:25:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,To ensure that nothing is wrong\Nwith our preparations,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.21,0:26:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,they have come all this way,\Nthough men are normally forbidden here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.38,0:26:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Asa, make sure they understand\Nwe do not need anyone overseeing us
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.54,0:26:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,by attending to them properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.29,0:26:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Ōoku!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.79,0:26:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, devote yourselves to the Ōoku!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.75,0:26:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to your positions immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.96,0:26:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.71,0:26:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Lady Asa\Nand Lady Kame are doing well.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.92,0:26:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Sakashita, what are \Nyour expectations for those two?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.50,0:27:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Asa should be fine,\Nbut I'm worried about Lady Kame.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.88,0:27:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Girls who are too nice often struggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.13,0:27:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But with the successful girls,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.67,0:27:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}they often change so much\Nthat they're like different people{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.46,0:27:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,when you next see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.08,0:27:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Asa!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.50,0:27:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- I've been studying the ways of the Ōoku.\N- Kame...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.71,0:27:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll help you guide the gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.88,0:27:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure to finish\Nmy own duties afterward.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.96,0:27:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- Um...\N- Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.71,0:27:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll hold you to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.38,0:27:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Recently, there was another girl \Nwho completely changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.54,0:27:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is she now?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.63,0:27:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard she left the Ōoku\Nand returned to the countryside.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.42,0:27:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.17,0:28:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What was the name of this maid?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.00,0:28:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Why must I tell someone like you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.00,0:28:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The bedchamber lies up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.33,0:28:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,To think that Lady Fuki\Nwalked these halls yesterday
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.00,0:28:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,to go and perform her night work...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.83,0:28:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my. How exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.75,0:28:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I have learned a lot.\NYou have my gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.75,0:28:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything here is so fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.00,0:28:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Asa, how long has it been\Nsince you joined the Ōoku?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.38,0:28:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed, Kame.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.54,0:28:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so knowledgeable.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.92,0:28:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The rice cake for the Birth Celebratory\NCeremony will go around the Ōoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.79,0:28:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, it will be brought here,\Nwhere the official scribe will...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.63,0:29:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Saburomaru, which one do you prefer?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.58,0:29:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on the job. Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.42,0:29:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to be shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.25,0:29:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.29,0:29:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The purification salt\Nshould have arrived by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.42,0:29:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It has been delayed due to bad weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.83,0:29:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I might acquire some\Nfrom a local wholesaler, just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.54,0:29:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Have Asa do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.50,0:29:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Asa?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.50,0:29:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Kame!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.88,0:29:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Awashima, how many years\Nhave you been in the Ōoku?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.13,0:29:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- I worked up an appetite!\N- {\i1}It has been six years.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.00,0:29:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I have made a point
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.04,0:29:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,of giving slightly more work\Nto those with talent and motivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.63,0:29:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That includes you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.42,0:29:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But to take on the role\Nof housemaid on one's first day...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.58,0:29:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even Kitagawa--
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.79,0:29:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Madam Awashima, take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.42,0:29:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Does this look like\Nthe work of a newcomer?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.17,0:29:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Asa wrote this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.79,0:29:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone loves themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.00,0:30:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We all want to be recognized, loved, and valued.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.83,0:30:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We cannot satisfy these wishes alone.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.75,0:30:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We expect our neighbors to satisfy us,\Nbut we are also compared to them.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.50,0:30:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Those same people \Ncompete with us for limited positions.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.46,0:30:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I will strive to improve.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.58,0:30:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want to talk with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.79,0:30:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like this has been\Nthe longest day of my life...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.54,0:30:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is what\Nthe private rooms look like!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.29,0:30:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope I get one of my own soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.54,0:30:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're amazing, Asa.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.13,0:31:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt anyone has ever been appointed \Nto an official position within one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.46,0:31:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Madam Utayama chose me \Nfor this role. I have to work hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.50,0:31:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll leave you to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.13,0:31:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What? You're leaving already?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.33,0:31:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to see the private rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.13,0:31:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a lowly maid. I need to \Nprepare bedding and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.71,0:31:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.63,0:31:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.00,0:31:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! See you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.29,0:32:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The umbrella...?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.25,0:32:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.29,0:32:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I left that here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.17,0:32:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,When I changed rooms,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.71,0:32:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I left it behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.50,0:32:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you previously use this room?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.17,0:32:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.38,0:32:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Kitagawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.92,0:32:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Kitagawa, my name is Asa.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.17,0:32:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Come now. You needn't be so formal.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.63,0:32:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Judging from your kimono,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.42,0:32:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,you must be the official scribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.33,0:32:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Such titles are \Nonly meaningful within the Ōoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.54,0:33:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I visited the Ōoku\N with my father as a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.38,0:33:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The Birth Celebratory Ceremony\Ninspired me back then,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.75,0:33:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,and I've dreamed of \Nworking in the Ōoku ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.54,0:33:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Behind the beautiful dancers,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.38,0:33:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,the scribe wielded \Nher brush with such strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.21,0:33:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I remember how that sight captivated me.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.88,0:33:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That was supposed to be my role\Nin the recent Birth Celebratory Ceremony.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.79,0:33:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I heard it was canceled due to some issue.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.21,0:33:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's right.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.63,0:33:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a wonderful brush.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.08,0:33:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you apply\Nfor the role of official scribe?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.54,0:33:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't possibly.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.13,0:33:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still far from that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.29,0:33:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to talk with you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.21,0:33:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,When it's just us two, never mind ranks.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.54,0:34:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.04,0:34:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you look after that doll for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.33,0:34:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.25,0:34:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll come to see her again too.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.79,0:34:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care. Rest well.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.33,0:34:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.88,0:34:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Good night!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.08,0:34:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady... Kitagawa...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.29,0:34:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All manner of misfortune...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.58,0:34:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, stay awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.46,0:34:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.63,0:34:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm always relying on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.50,0:34:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.58,0:34:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Cleanse{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.71,0:35:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}By the will of heaven{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.92,0:35:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let's go!\N- Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.67,0:35:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- Father!\N- Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.13,0:35:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Good girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.21,0:35:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this mess?!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.38,0:35:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you\Nto finish this yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.88,0:35:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.79,0:35:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's not that...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.67,0:35:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! I'll hurry up and do it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.33,0:35:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Starting now? They'll never dry!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.96,0:35:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why it needed to be done yesterday!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.38,0:35:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't something\Nyou could just put off 'til today.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.00,0:35:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, you have \Nother work for today, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.17,0:35:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.25,0:35:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you ashamed\Nof such half-baked work?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.38,0:35:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.17,0:36:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,L-Lady Asa! Her duties!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.50,0:36:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,She didn't finish her work!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.13,0:36:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,My deepest apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.33,0:36:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I failed to check.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.46,0:36:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Unacceptable.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.96,0:36:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the purification salt\NI asked for yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.13,0:36:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder how that worked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.75,0:36:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.38,0:36:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I sent someone right after\Nreceiving your instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.88,0:36:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It arrived first thing this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.08,0:36:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh...\N- Impressive work!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.83,0:36:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,From Lady Asa, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.42,0:36:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But then there's {\i1}you{\i}.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.42,0:36:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Madam Awashima!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.83,0:36:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Kame didn't wake up\Nto prepare breakfast this morning either.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.71,0:36:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you make of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.17,0:36:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.54,0:36:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my fault for not asking Lady Kame to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.33,0:36:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Though it was a task meant for two people,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.42,0:36:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I could handle it alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.71,0:36:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I was misguided.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.42,0:36:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So in other words,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.13,0:36:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,the only thing \Nyou can do is flirt with men!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.79,0:37:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- Don't say--\N- Madam Mugitani!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.25,0:37:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Men distracted you from \Nyesterday's work, and today you overslept!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.58,0:37:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know whether you're lazy or easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.50,0:37:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- But if you saw--\N- Well, well!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.13,0:37:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Was {\i1}I{\i} not thoughtful enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.46,0:37:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- I didn't mean--\N- What {\i1}did{\i} you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.29,0:37:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.17,0:37:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Kame, collect your things\Nand move to Madam Mugitani's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.58,0:37:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You are to learn from scratch\Nexactly what your duties entail.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.00,0:37:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And Madam Mugitani.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.92,0:37:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Please behave as an Ōoku maid should.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.25,0:37:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes, ma'am.\N- I was the one at fault, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.71,0:37:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,My, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.04,0:37:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You were just promoted.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.08,0:37:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you take on the task\Nof instructing Lady Kame too?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.46,0:37:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am. If that is my duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.92,0:37:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- I humbly accept it.\N- What...?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.50,0:37:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I will...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.67,0:37:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I will be careful \Nfrom now on! I'll work hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.71,0:37:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- No!\N- I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.38,0:37:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take responsibility\Nfor dealing with this girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.42,0:37:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm sorry!\N- Kame--
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.21,0:38:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Such beautiful hands...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.13,0:38:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems that one of the maids\Nfell ill two months ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.79,0:38:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,and then left the Ōoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.67,0:38:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And nobody has been told clearly
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.33,0:38:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,why the Birth Celebratory \NCeremony was postponed.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.42,0:38:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we get\Nthe shogunate to look into this?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.00,0:38:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What a splendid device.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.58,0:38:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a pair of scales.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.54,0:38:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Scales?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.71,0:38:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So how does it work?\NAnd what does it measure?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.25,0:38:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What people...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.21,0:38:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What people...?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.79,0:38:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,...cannot see, and how far away that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.21,0:38:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.54,0:38:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not really serious\Nabout your duties, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.79,0:38:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.71,0:39:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying... my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.04,0:39:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't wake up early.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.13,0:39:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I try to remember what I'm told,\Nbut I always end up forgetting.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.04,0:39:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't do a good job like other people,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.25,0:39:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,and I constantly get left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.96,0:39:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you even come to the Ōoku for?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.46,0:39:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.92,0:39:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've seen your type before.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.42,0:39:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Just because you're easy on the eye
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.88,0:39:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,you think you can slack off!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.88,0:39:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,All you care about is \Ngetting into His Majesty's bed!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.00,0:39:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's not true...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.29,0:40:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.00,0:40:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Stop! Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.04,0:40:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If you plan to take this job seriously,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.50,0:40:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,you won't need all this!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.79,0:40:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.42,0:40:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.46,0:40:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Cross this line and you'll lose your head!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.04,0:40:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,A {\i1}mononoke{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.79,0:40:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,has appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.17,0:40:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.17,0:40:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.17,0:40:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an emergency!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.04,0:41:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,In the back?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.04,0:41:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! You can't come in--
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.71,0:41:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What are these?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.50,0:41:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.92,0:41:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The kaleidoscope...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.96,0:41:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Sakashita!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.17,0:41:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the intruder...?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.08,0:41:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Madam Awashima!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.46,0:41:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Above?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.38,0:41:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- Don't go!\N- Wait--
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.71,0:41:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Madam Awashima?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.83,0:41:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. It seems she heard a terrible scream\Nthat sounded like Madam Mugitani.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.83,0:41:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Has it gone?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.21,0:41:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait--
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.92,0:41:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What's all the commotion?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.92,0:41:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Kame!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.75,0:41:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,She's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.71,0:41:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Was Lady Kame the only one here?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.29,0:41:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard Madam Mugitani was also here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.58,0:41:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It helps that you're so calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.42,0:41:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Kame...?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.08,0:42:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll wake up...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.04,0:42:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- Looks like...\N- Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.29,0:42:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't make it on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.00,0:42:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- That rumbling sound...\N- What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.00,0:42:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Mugitani.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.75,0:42:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This is... not the work of any human.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.88,0:42:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- Who are you?!\N- Not a human...?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.25,0:42:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm simply... a medicine seller.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.13,0:42:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You're guilty of intruding\N into the Ōoku and causing disorder!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.21,0:42:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, you're facing something\Nthat cannot be slain by that sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.00,0:42:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the work of a {\i1}mononoke{\i}.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.79,0:42:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}- Mono...\N- ...noke{\i}?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.17,0:42:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The cause of these apparitions...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.88,0:42:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- Apparitions?\N- There is no such thing in the Ōoku!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.04,0:43:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.25,0:43:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,to slay this {\i1}mononoke{\i}!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.58,0:43:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,As the wet floor dries, a circle appears.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.96,0:43:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This {\i1}mononoke{\i}...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.54,0:43:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Once an {\i1}ayakashi{\i}, its name is Karakasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.67,0:43:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Madam Mugitani...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.21,0:43:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.29,0:43:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I have identified... its Form.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.83,0:43:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Form?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.25,0:43:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The apparitions can only be quelled\Nif I slay the {\i1}mononoke{\i}.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.13,0:43:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The kaleidoscope...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.08,0:43:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,However, the power of a human\Ncannot slay a {\i1}mononoke{\i}.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.29,0:43:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And so, I have this sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.58,0:43:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Kon is one of the \Neight swords of Yin and Yang.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.75,0:44:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This great sword of the realm of Shuga\Nis entrusted to the 64 guardians.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.33,0:44:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It is also known as
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.54,0:44:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,the Sacred Sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.75,0:44:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you slay it\Nwith that sword immediately?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.88,0:44:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Drawing this sword\Nrequires certain conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.38,0:44:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Conditions?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.71,0:44:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Form.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.67,0:44:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.71,0:44:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.79,0:44:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Without these three elements,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.00,0:44:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot draw the sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.79,0:44:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Truth is the way things appear.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.88,0:44:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Reason is the true nature of the passions
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.13,0:44:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,that smolder here in the Ōoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.13,0:44:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you mean that \Nif you show the sword these three elements,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.21,0:44:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,you can slay this so-called {\i1}mononoke{\i}?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.42,0:44:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.17,0:44:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And in order to present\Nthese three elements...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.67,0:44:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sakashita.\N- Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.92,0:44:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- Provide this man with a pass.\N- Madam Utayama?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.92,0:45:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to destroy\Nthis thing you call "Karakasa."
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.88,0:45:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You are not to speak a word\Nof tonight's incident to anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.00,0:45:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And until the end\Nof the Birth Celebratory Ceremony,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.67,0:45:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Mugitani is not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.58,0:45:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.58,0:45:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand, Awashima?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.38,0:45:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I... understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.75,0:45:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.38,0:45:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I would like to \Nask you all to share with me...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.17,0:45:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,your own Truths... and Reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.83,0:46:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All manner of misfortune{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.08,0:46:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sin and defilement{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.29,0:46:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Purify--{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.21,0:46:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the water delicious? Heavenly...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.13,0:46:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.83,0:46:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The Water Goddess, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.21,0:46:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Grant us good fortune{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.42,0:47:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Could I ask you not to \Ndismiss Lady Kame yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.92,0:47:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We have no place
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.38,0:47:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,for those who are weak\Nor cannot contribute.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.00,0:47:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We can usually tell who they are\Nwithin the first three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.21,0:47:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I will leave you to deal with Kame.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.54,0:47:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.92,0:47:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A peddler from the Nanatsu Gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.79,0:47:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, please listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.50,0:47:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Mugitani had to return to \Nher family home, suddenly.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.42,0:48:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- What's going on?\N- Come on now...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.63,0:48:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,She left early this morning,\Nso she couldn't say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.21,0:48:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.13,0:48:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,She who carries a heavy burden\Ngains the strength to climb the next step.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.13,0:48:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I would like to \Nappoint Asa as head housemaid
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.17,0:48:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,and have her take over from Mugitani.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.92,0:48:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Head housemaid?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.83,0:48:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Has this ever happened before?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.04,0:48:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Asa...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.13,0:48:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I entrust you with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.25,0:48:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.13,0:48:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems the maid we talked about\Nnever actually made it home.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.38,0:48:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.54,0:48:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That maid's name is...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.29,0:48:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is there a peddler in the Ōoku?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.75,0:48:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You ought to be beheaded!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.38,0:48:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you ask Madam Utayama?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.83,0:48:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Madam Utayama is\Na powerful political figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.96,0:49:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to follow her example.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.83,0:49:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What? A sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.08,0:49:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a maid I'd like to ask you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.63,0:49:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Does the water taste good?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.08,0:49:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Kitagawa...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.33,0:49:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes one must discard \Nsomething in order to move forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.08,0:49:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Asa, I wonder what you will discard.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.21,0:49:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,All I had were things I wished to discard.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.79,0:49:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But some things must not be discarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.63,0:49:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Not all of them...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.33,0:49:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,...are tangible.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.54,0:49:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Discard those, and you will dry out.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.71,0:49:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I have something\NI wish to keep from drying out.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.42,0:49:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That is why... I must throw it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.25,0:50:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Asa.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.04,0:50:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.25,0:50:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to see Madam Mugitani.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.08,0:50:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.63,0:50:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You can work with me today.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.13,0:50:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.00,0:50:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.17,0:50:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you take on the task\Nof attending to visitors
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.13,0:50:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,at the ceremony?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.21,0:50:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Madam Utayama, I am not your subordinate.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.71,0:50:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,As a member of the Otomo family,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.50,0:50:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I deal only with the dynamics\Nbetween the Ōoku and the outside world.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.25,0:50:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't mince words.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.00,0:51:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We maids must not approach the bedchamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.25,0:51:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the rule of the Ōoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.63,0:51:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he a magician?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.00,0:52:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.46,0:52:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Karakasa... is close.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.17,0:52:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Karakasa?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.25,0:52:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.08,0:52:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be that your goal
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.46,0:52:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,is to cause problems
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.92,0:52:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,and jeopardize \Nmy position as your superior?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.58,0:52:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Such neat writing.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.42,0:52:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got it wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.04,0:52:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,After meeting Asa here \Nin the Ōoku, I knew I was in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.17,0:52:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I could never do things the way she does.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.17,0:52:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, I'll be sent away.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.17,0:52:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So I thought
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.13,0:52:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,if I could catch His Majesty's eye...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.83,0:53:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you plaguing us\Nbecause we made you throw away your comb?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.42,0:53:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.33,0:53:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no {\i1}mononoke{\i}, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.83,0:53:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mononoke{\i}?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.58,0:53:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You hid Mugitani, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.79,0:53:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You and Asa!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.42,0:53:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what this is about...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.21,0:53:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Asa put you up to all of this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.96,0:53:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You just do whatever you want
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.25,0:53:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,and slack off on any job you don't like!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.13,0:53:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- There's nothing more cowardly!\N- Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.92,0:53:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this a dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.13,0:53:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Just follow him!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.67,0:53:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That sneaky look!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.67,0:53:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Nasty little girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.13,0:53:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.67,0:53:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Madam Utayama!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.17,0:53:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I never wanted to throw it away!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.96,0:54:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.75,0:54:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't open!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.83,0:54:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't open!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.58,0:54:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.88,0:54:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorr--
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.54,0:54:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll take... responsibility{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.00,0:54:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}for dealing with this girl.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.79,0:54:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The Medicine Seller and \Nthe two inspectors are causing a commotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.50,0:54:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.42,0:54:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,They say there's a {\i1}mononoke{\i}!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.21,0:54:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- What's happening?\N- Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.92,0:54:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Take her!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.25,0:54:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait--
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.42,0:55:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This one... is beyond saving.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.04,0:55:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So it turns humans into rainwater?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.63,0:55:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll find Lady Kame\Nby the earthen floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.38,0:55:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Kame!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.63,0:55:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Two months ago,\Na maid disappeared from the Ōoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.17,0:55:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Supposedly, she was going back\Nto her family home after being dismissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.58,0:55:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But she vanished like smoke,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.46,0:56:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,and nobody knows where she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.46,0:56:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Madam Mugitani really\Nreturn home this morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.46,0:56:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And two months ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.67,0:56:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,the Birth Celebratory \NCeremony was postponed.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.04,0:56:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this truly a coincidence?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.63,0:56:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No use, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.00,0:56:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's close.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.75,0:56:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.96,0:56:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This matter is none of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.67,0:56:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you\Nthat was reported to Councilor Otomo?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.79,0:56:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.71,0:56:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The missing maid. What is her name?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.46,0:56:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- Lady Kitagawa's...\N- The former official scribe of the Ōoku...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.79,0:56:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Kitagawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.71,0:56:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I have identified its Truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.96,0:56:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Kitagawa is its Truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.08,0:56:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The {\i1}mononoke{\i}...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.17,0:56:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,is coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.75,0:57:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.92,0:57:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That right there is the {\i1}mononoke{\i},
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.75,0:57:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Karakasa!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.04,0:57:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,My apologies!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.58,0:57:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not yet Karakasa's final form.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.17,0:57:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Once it takes form in this world,\Nit will become unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.33,0:57:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Awashima!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.63,0:57:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What is happening in the Ōoku?!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.96,0:57:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I intend to proceed as planned
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.88,0:57:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,with the Birth Celebratory Ceremony!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.33,0:58:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm too scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.50,0:58:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Asa, don't let go\Nof my hand until morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.96,0:58:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.04,0:58:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Promise me! Let go,\Nand I'll never speak to you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.88,0:58:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise I won't let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.75,0:58:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.83,0:58:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I met Lady Kitagawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.13,0:58:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You met her? But Lady Kitagawa is...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.67,0:58:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I mustn't dry out.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.58,0:58:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.38,0:58:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I realized that.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.25,0:58:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to Lady Kitagawa,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.17,0:58:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I realized what was precious.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.00,0:58:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What I mustn't throw away.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.83,0:58:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's good!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.58,0:58:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.08,0:58:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- So what was it?\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.46,0:58:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Your precious thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.54,0:58:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.58,0:59:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Tell me! Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.25,0:59:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I have something to tell you, Kame.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.54,0:59:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.96,0:59:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Something... important.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.88,0:59:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't get in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.71,0:59:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.29,0:59:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Madam Awashima passed away\N{\i1}after{\i} the Birth Celebratory Ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.38,0:59:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But why...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.71,0:59:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Performing the ceremony is merely a duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.63,0:59:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But many people have poured\Ntheir hearts and souls into this duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.04,0:59:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Can a job be that important?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.71,0:59:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it your job
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.46,0:59:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,to find fault with Madam Utayama\Nand bring about her downfall?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.38,0:59:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Asa...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.04,0:59:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll send a messenger later.\NYour work can wait until tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.50,0:59:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Until the ceremony is over,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.33,1:00:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not allow\Nany disturbances in the Ōoku.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.96,1:00:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Grant us good fortune{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.38,1:00:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So you spoke with Lady Kitagawa?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.96,1:00:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought the Medicine Seller\Nmight be able to protect you, Asa.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.21,1:00:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps we can get closer\Nto the {\i1}mononoke{\i}'s Reason.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.83,1:00:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I do not know\Nwhat happened to Lady Kitagawa.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.08,1:00:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.75,1:00:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,However?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.83,1:00:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I now feel like I understand
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.83,1:00:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Kitagawa's feelings a little more.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.08,1:00:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Her feelings?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.08,1:00:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I couldn't be of more use.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.08,1:00:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it helps a little.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.92,1:01:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But the real mystery is Madam Utayama.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.58,1:01:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does she overlook these apparitions?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.79,1:01:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- Good point.\N- Why go forward with the ceremony?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.33,1:01:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Ōoku.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.63,1:01:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes, one must suppress\None's own feelings to do one's duty.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.21,1:01:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Based on whether one can do that,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.21,1:01:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I discern a person's suitability\Nfor important roles.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.17,1:01:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- And Lady Kitagawa?\N- I assessed her too.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.54,1:01:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That means\Nthe {\i1}mononoke{\i}'s next target will be...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.67,1:01:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If you canceled the ceremony\Nlike you did two months ago,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.17,1:01:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,wouldn't that quell the apparitions?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.92,1:01:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that what you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.83,1:01:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Madam Utayama...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.96,1:01:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our duty.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.75,1:02:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.04,1:02:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,A {\i1}mononoke{\i}? Spooky!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.71,1:02:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the ceremony?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.17,1:02:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,People have died. It must be canceled--
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.71,1:02:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The Birth Celebratory Ceremony\Nwill be carried out as planned.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.50,1:02:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,She looked like a mummified monk.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.92,1:02:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- Taking over from the late Madam Awashima...\N- She was turned into a mummy.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.58,1:02:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Madam Awashima must have suffered greatly.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.67,1:02:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The day of\Nthe Birth Celebratory Ceremony is upon us.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.92,1:02:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I would appreciate your full cooperation.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.33,1:03:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- His Majesty, his consort, and the baby.\N- She isn't holding back.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.42,1:03:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- The event must proceed smoothly for them.\N- Is this okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.00,1:03:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's begin\Nthe Birth Celebratory Ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.08,1:03:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, please go to your positions.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.13,1:03:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.63,1:03:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.08,1:03:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Heave-ho! Heave-ho!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.71,1:03:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Heave-ho! Heave-ho!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.71,1:03:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Once the celebration starts,\Nthe excitement is over all too soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.46,1:03:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Time waits for nobody.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.63,1:03:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry you are unable to participate.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.92,1:03:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's fine.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.92,1:03:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's how it is behind the scenes.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.88,1:04:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,At least if I'm here,\Neven when the {\i1}mononoke{\i}--
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.58,1:04:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember what you told me\Nwhen we first met.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.00,1:04:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That I would gain \Na higher perspective as I progressed.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.88,1:04:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You were right, Madam Utayama.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.13,1:04:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have now come to see{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.25,1:04:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the insignificance of the pain\NI'd experienced until that point.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.88,1:04:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When you stand above others,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.58,1:04:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}you see things differently.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.54,1:04:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw a version of myself\Nthat wasn't fazed by anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.46,1:04:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Heave-ho! Heave-ho!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.83,1:04:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But at the same time,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.29,1:04:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}something kept my emotions\Nfrom going astray.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.13,1:04:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That was...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.29,1:04:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Kame.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.17,1:04:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Kame? Have you decided\Nhow to deal with her?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.13,1:04:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- {\i1}I have asked her to leave the Ōoku.{\i}\N- I wanted to become a concubine.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.21,1:04:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to wear a beautiful kimono\Nfor His Majesty...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.21,1:04:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You were decisive{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.71,1:05:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,and unswayed by emotion.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.92,1:05:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I also
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.79,1:05:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}wanted to eat together with Kame.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.50,1:05:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wanted to spend more time\Ntalking with her late into the night.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.29,1:05:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I have Lady Kitagawa to thank.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.08,1:05:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Kitagawa?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.00,1:05:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,...against anybody!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.50,1:05:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Madam Utayama!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.63,1:05:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the {\i1}mononoke{\i} here?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.38,1:06:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I threw it away...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.38,1:06:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Medicine Seller!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.63,1:06:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't slay it soon,\Nwe're in trouble!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.96,1:07:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I need the Reason.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.17,1:07:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't draw my sword, we're done for!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.33,1:07:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Madam Utayama!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.54,1:07:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- What did you throw away?\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.25,1:07:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's trying to get through to this side!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.92,1:07:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is Karakasa after you?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.08,1:07:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.96,1:07:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The ceiling!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.08,1:07:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.50,1:07:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Saburomaru...?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.83,1:08:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,All dried out...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.29,1:08:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Kitagawa?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.21,1:08:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Kitagawa!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.58,1:08:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Kitagawa...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.25,1:08:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I am...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.42,1:08:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,all dried out.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.29,1:08:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's Lady Kitagawa?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.00,1:08:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Karakasa is...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.29,1:08:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,manifesting in this world!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.17,1:09:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The first time I was urged\Nto throw away a cherished item,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.46,1:09:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I discarded it without hesitation.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.42,1:09:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}By discarding it,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.88,1:10:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I resolved to become a different person.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.71,1:10:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Thanks to Madam Utayama's favor,\NI steadily rose through the ranks.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.00,1:10:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There was another girl who entered\Nthe Ōoku at the same time as me.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.50,1:10:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She struggled to fit in\Nand was so forgetful.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.92,1:10:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I became increasingly irritated with her.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.29,1:10:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was given an important role\Nin the Birth Celebratory Ceremony.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.29,1:10:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}On that day, I told her{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.96,1:10:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}to leave the Ōoku.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.63,1:10:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I thought I would worry less\Nand be able to focus on my duties.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.42,1:10:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's what I thought...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.38,1:10:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But I was wrong.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.25,1:11:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I began wondering\Nwhat had changed within me.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.21,1:11:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I realized that I was all dried out.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.63,1:11:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Before I knew it,\NI had lost the will to work.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.63,1:11:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was stripped of my role.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.38,1:11:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I could no longer leave my room.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.00,1:11:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}To become dried out,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.71,1:11:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I must have thrown something away.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.42,1:11:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Something important.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.08,1:11:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'd thrown it away... down there.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.50,1:12:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.75,1:12:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Kame--
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.71,1:12:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Asa!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.29,1:12:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be... okay!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.08,1:12:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Kitagawa?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.58,1:12:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Kitagawa told me...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.13,1:13:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,that I mustn't dry out.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.75,1:13:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Does she hold a grudge?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.25,1:13:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe\NLady Kitagawa holds a grudge
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.08,1:13:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,against anybody!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.46,1:13:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,My duty...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.21,1:13:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.13,1:13:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,my...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.88,1:13:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,duty!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.88,1:13:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It stinks.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.67,1:13:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The Reason... has been revealed.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.58,1:13:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Form.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.21,1:13:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.83,1:14:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Reason.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.79,1:14:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,With these three elements in place,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.13,1:14:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I will release
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.88,1:14:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,my sword!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.25,1:14:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Release!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.83,1:15:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Karakasa.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.29,1:15:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to be cut down,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.42,1:15:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,purified, and laid to rest.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.96,1:15:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mononoke.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.21,1:15:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.96,1:15:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Strike!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.88,1:16:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.00,1:17:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And down!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.96,1:17:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- Is that the {\i1}mononoke{\i}?\N- Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.00,1:17:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go together.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.96,1:17:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your precious thing! Could it be...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.75,1:17:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't say!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.83,1:17:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.96,1:17:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear me...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.00,1:18:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall fulfill my duty.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.96,1:18:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.96,1:18:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.96,1:18:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.83,1:18:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.75,1:19:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I will now...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.50,1:19:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,humbly take my leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.79,1:19:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Medicine Seller!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.50,1:19:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I still... cannot see
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.92,1:19:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,its Form.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.17,1:20:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,She was smiling.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.00,1:29:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=9}Subtitle translation by: Mari Koch
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.00,1:29:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
